1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,710
(Leonard:)What you doing?

2
00:00:02,710 --> 00:00:05,510
(Sheldon:)I'm setting out snacks.

3
00:00:05,510 --> 00:00:07,960
(Leonard:)You do realize everyone's eating
at Raj's again tonight.

4
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:12,700
(Sheldon:)I didn't say the snacks were
for you now, did I, Nosy Rosie?

5
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:18,340
(Leonard:)You're having people over?

6
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:20,680
(Sheldon:)Yes. Must be killing you
wondering who.

7
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:22,140
(Sheldon:)Fine, I'll tell you.

8
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:24,910
(Sheldon:)Stuart from the
comic bookstore,

9
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:26,410
(Sheldon:)Barry Kripke from
the university,

10
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:28,620
(Sheldon:)Penny's ex-boyfriend Zack

11
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,750
(Sheldon:)and TV's LeVar Burton.

12
00:00:32,190 --> 00:00:33,920
(Leonard:)Really?

13
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:35,690
(Leonard:)LeVar Burton's coming here?

14
00:00:35,690 --> 00:00:38,230
(Sheldon:)Possibly. I Tweeted him.

15
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:42,160
Okay, well, tell him
I loved him on Star Trek.

16
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:45,600
(Sheldon:)Please, Leonard, stop trying
to horn in on my new friends.

17
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:48,140
(Leonard:)Of course. Good night.

18
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:50,560
(Sheldon:)Leonard.
Yeah?

19
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:53,040
(Sheldon:)We had a good run, you and I.

20
00:00:55,140 --> 00:00:57,680
(Leonard:)Okay.

21
00:00:58,480 --> 00:01:00,550
(Sheldon:)But change is a part of life.

